      "typical_award_size": "HHAP-6 remainder of $1,386,379 offered in the 2027 Action Plan NOFA ($1,275,468.68 available after 7% admin and 1% HMIS; 10% youth set-aside $138,637.90). HSOC priorities (March 18, 2026): capital for permanent housing $100,000, permanent housing services $116,049, interim housing services $849,419, rapid rehousing $210,000. HCD HHAP-6 allocations: County $1,340,780.92 and CoC $1,431,977.08; HHAP-7 preliminary: County $1,576,336.64 and CoC $1,688,932.11. State ESG $190,735 also in the NOFA. County General Fund Support adds $379,000 a year for shelters and homeless programs.",
