      "prevailing_wage_basis": "No program rule found. The HCD HHAP Round 6 amended NOFA (95 pages, also governing HHAP 7 disbursements) and the County 2027 Action Plan NOFA HHAP section contain no prevailing wage or Labor Code requirement; the County NOFA cites Davis-Bacon only for HOME (12+ HOME units, 24 CFR 92.354) and CDBG. Any obligation on HHAP capital for permanent housing would rest on the general Labor Code 1720(b) public-funds definition and depends on 1720(c) exemptions and project facts.",
